  "notes_for_reviewer": "Official students.pw.edu.pl pages (WUT International Students Office: B.Sc. offer and M.Sc. offer, both for the academic year 2026/2027, M.Sc. page updated 19 October 2026) read 2026-10-25. Tuition for non-EU citizens is EUR and the column is headed \"TUITION FEE (one semester)\" on both pages, so it is stored per semester; EU/EFTA fees (PLN) are not stored. The pages do not say that the programmes are taught in English (it is the offer of the International Students Office): English is stored as the language and should be confirmed on the programme pages. Durations are in semesters on the pages (1 semester = 1/2 year). Intakes: October and/or February; no application dates, entrance requirements or application fees are on the pages (documents are a standard guess and should be checked). Aerospace Engineering: Aerospace Propulsion Systems (M.Sc.) is NOT included (no fee or duration on the page). \"Applied Computer Science\" (M.Sc.) is hybrid/part-time and is stored as blended. The B.Sc. specialisations Photonic Engineering and Telecommunications appear in the sidebar but not in the 2026/2027 table and are not included. The actual semester fee follows the ECTS plan of each student (WUT regulations), so the amount is the official non-EU tuition for the offer."
